+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0+
+/*
+ * Allwinner H713 HDMI RX Driver
+ *
+ * Scope: EDID-RAM preload + HPD-pin control + bridge skeleton.
+ * The TMDS-decode path is owned entirely by the on-SoC video MIPS
+ * (display.bin / Connect_Link_Path). ARM kernel does not initialize
+ * any HDMI-RX PHY register directly.
+ *
+ * Real H713 HDMI-RX register layout (DISASM-verified Session-S, 2026-04-29):
+ *   0x06800800-0x068008FF  controller (port-select, PHY-reset bit @0x8FC)
+ *   0x06840000-0x068408FF  per-port state (byte-multiplexed)
+ *   0x07091014             ARISC HPD-pin (already wired via separate path)
+ *
+ * Earlier "h713_phy_phase1..5[]" tables (sessions A-R) were extracted from
+ * display.bin offset 0x130030 and treated as PHY init. They are actually
+ * video-scaler filter coefficients (COEF_FLT) — REMOVED here.
+ *
+ * Copyright (c) 2026 HY310 Project
+ */
+
