+	depends on ARCH_SUNXI || COMPILE_TEST
+	select DRM_KMS_HELPER
+	help
+	  Support for the HDMI-RX block found on the Allwinner H713 SoC.
+	  Used on the HY310 DLP projector to receive HDMI from an external
+	  source (laptop, console). The block is register-compatible with
+	  the Synopsys DesignWare HDMI-RX controller for DDC/EDID/HDCP, but
+	  uses a custom H713 PHY at 0x05040000 driven by the 5-phase init
+	  sequence reverse-engineered from the stock display.bin firmware.
+
+	  The driver pre-loads the EDID-RAM from /lib/firmware/hy310-edid.bin
+	  (built from the stock vendor EDID) so the source side gets a sane
+	  DDC response immediately after HPD assertion.
+
+	  If unsure, say N.
